LUMA SUMMARY:
Punday Night proper. Cozmo introduces the paradox/pair-o-docs pun and realizes the machines do not literally hear words, so phonetic comparison may need an explicit helper layer. He proposes each node’s “Uhura Ear” and launches a playful pun contest/exploration while deliberately leaving bugs and architecture alone until later.
